[00:01.00]作曲 : Martin Tungevaag/Harper Russ/Henning Olerud
[00:07.89]I've been thinking bout wrong / 是非对错都想过
[00:09.90]I've been thinking bout right / 纠结半天没结果
[00:11.73]I just wanna thrive / 只想好好爽一把
[00:13.56]I don't wanna fight / 我才不想瞎较劲
[00:17.25]I don't wanna fight / 我才不想瞎拌嘴
[00:22.41]Can you see / 宝贝快点抬头看
[00:23.19]the flickering lights  baby / 灯光闪烁真带感
[00:26.25]Put your glass up in the air / 酒杯举到半空中
[00:28.74]with me / 跟我一起嗨起来
[00:29.94]Hollar hollar let them hear us / 大声欢呼别停下
[00:32.49]loudly / 让每个人都听见
[00:33.60]Our top is off / 敞开心扉别害羞
